        <item>
          <title>Microsoft moves to limit AI use by its employees</title>
          <description><![CDATA[Until recently, it was common for companies and organizations to engage in “tokenmaxxing” — that is, maximizing their use of AI. But with AI costs going up, companies are now looking to save money, a trend underscored by a recent Microsoft decision to limit AI use by its employees.]]></description>
